<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld name="Slide 6"><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Text 0"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="502920"/><a:ext cx="10789920" cy="237744"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="8A929B"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Avery Weigh-Tronix India  ·  Google Ads  ·  ₹17.5 lakh  ·  20 months</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Text 1"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="7863840" cy="914400"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="3200"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2500" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>The account could not be judged,</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2500" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="3200"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2500" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>because the numbers were not true</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2500" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Text 2"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="2103120"/><a:ext cx="9692640" cy="822960"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1863"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Conversion tracking was firing incorrectly, so nobody could say which keywords were bringing buyers, and Google was bidding on bad data. At the same time the search terms report was filling up with students, job seekers and spare part queries. The two problems fed each other.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Shape 3"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="3200400"/><a:ext cx="10735056" cy="8230"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="6" name="Text 4"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="3310128" cy="457200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1600"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Fixed the measurement first</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="Text 5"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="4005072"/><a:ext cx="3310128" cy="1371600"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1550"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>I rebuilt the conversion setup before touching a bid or a budget. Nothing above it could be trusted until the events fired properly, and it also gave the client visibility they had been missing.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Shape 6"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4251960" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="8230" cy="1828800"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="9" name="Text 7"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4480560" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="3310128" cy="457200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1600"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Cleaned the traffic weekly</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="10" name="Text 8"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4480560" y="4005072"/><a:ext cx="3310128" cy="1371600"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1550"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Built out negatives against students, job seekers, repair and spare part searches, and price shopping. In industrial search this moves quality more than any bid change.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="11" name="Shape 9"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8019288" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="8230" cy="1828800"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="12" name="Text 10"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8247888" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="3310128" cy="457200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1600"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Separated brand from generic</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="13" name="Text 11"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8247888" y="4005072"/><a:ext cx="3310128" cy="1371600"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1550"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Split brand out so cheap branded conversions stopped flattering the generic campaigns. Then matched the bid strategy to the data available in each one.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>